WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.491 --> 00:00:11.776
Today’s task: a stick of 8 in two colors. Tap to add cubes.

2
00:00:11.776 --> 00:00:15.226
Drag a cube against another. It snaps on.

3
00:00:15.226 --> 00:00:20.604
Snap the rest the same way: 5 red and 3 blue.

4
00:00:20.604 --> 00:00:23.384
Drag a stick and its cubes move along. 5 + 3 = 8.

5
00:00:23.384 --> 00:00:26.788
Hold a cube, then slide it away to break the stick: 7 and 1.

6
00:00:26.788 --> 00:00:29.454
Drag across empty space to select several at once.

7
00:00:29.454 --> 00:00:31.781
Drag one, and they all move together.

8
00:00:31.781 --> 00:00:37.706
Every task has its prompt and a teacher note, below the board.
